  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CONSORTIUM JEUNESSE SENEGAL</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Green Climate Challenge Fund is a new concept from Embassy Dakar, aligning with the priorities of the Government of Ireland and with the principles of Locally Led-Adaptation, aimed at providing Senegalese organisations, who do not normally have the capacity to apply for or manage larger budgets, with the support to deliver impactful, purpose-driven projects in their communities. The Green Climate Challenge Fund will be implemented by the Consortium Jeunesse Senegal.  The project will support and assist project leaders in Senegal, particularly women and young people, by financing and strengthening initiatives that address climate and environmental issues in order to build community resilience.</narrative>
  </description>
